# Performance investigation checklist (attach by hand when needed)

- Record with the React Profiler before changing anything; save the flamegraph in the PR.
- Turn on why-did-you-render for the suspect component only.
- Check the network tab for request waterfalls before blaming rendering.
- Measure again after the change, same scenario, and put both numbers in the PR.
